<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 15:57:21 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">James</para>
  <para style="toc1">James ne raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="toc2">James</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jas.</para>
  <para style="mt">James</para>
  <para style="mt">James ne raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">James laisiukwak de Samkakkelu Kehecibe gade laisiu raitube lubui, AD 48 dau raugai. Laisiu aide, Jisu sinabe nah Jerusalem ngqwa ga muiteu teikelabe ne raupwa, kehei ga kela Khristianme pelane dage raugai. Samkakkelu Keheci laisiukwak hena James gade Jude kecangde de maadibe laisiu lie qula, kedanemene laisiu cidungde au Khristianme pelane dage kaibam nah ngqwa ket dage rünne kai kemakne.</para>
  <para style="ip">James laisiu aide raukegai au peu Khristianme de Khristianme teilung de mzai eh lunghlu kerane. Pa rangbi kegai anui kenlum kesangbe bamcai, anui cide Khristianme nzwa tei mzai lia luzie lie ranggai. Pa rata nah kesamlim, keku teuntsam kecu, mi mleu kezeu kecu, ngang kecu, helungtie kecu, nah kekie aipau hadung ga keledeusam ranggai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Renet kesangbe (1:1-27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tei kemzai ga kenlum kesangbe (2:1-3:12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tei kemzai ga maci kesangbe (3:13-5:12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kenlum kekie (5:13-20)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s">Keraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />James, Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista kilabe ne raupwa zangra la kedi heleuh kereiekena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Heleuh kereiekena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Jewme kenlumme penui deudi gwale, keraide Syria nah Asia Minor ga lungh kebamme de rangbam.</char></note> dage kekai: Kelum gaila!<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kedei nah mdakkepie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />A sinamedung, kenaang ketsamtsam nnui da kegwang dau, cidungde pelane suiyi ge lie cet lulo, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />kedanemene nnui kenlum kedak pie kecu gade helungketie petlu kela nnui cibam lu. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Dede peu helungketie de de peta teicanglu, iciu de nnui magede cang kemak tei mene, yicang siak nah canglu kerane. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Cu nnui keheibe de maci gahcai, peu pecu Tinggwang, mbang süt eh nah kesiu mene pelane de pwapeu kelabe dade kie lulo, iciude pecu cide pwapeu zie. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Dede peu pecu magede lunghau di mene, kenlum gade kielu, kedanemene lunghau kelabe au jaaidi ga dui nswak, tingkai ne lule ailam gui gwangkelade nzwa da. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Cine peu mina cipaude de Rampaube dade magede ngaulu kera cet so, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />mina lungna kecume, pa ketei leune gade ntiplu lama. <verse eid="JAS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Dede siname ma gah kelame de peu pecu teucuh kebeu ziemne pesui lu, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />nah ma heikelame de peu pecu tei henah kegai ziemne pesui lu, kedanemene pa renaam mapa ge nzwa huidi zielu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:11">Lei. 102:11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:7-8">Isa. 40:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Kedanemene tingnaimiak lum süt eh cuh tsehei puki dila, nah pe pa hui dila, nah hezu keyi cide gah dila. Cinzwa eh, makeheibe de pa peta tei keladau hui nggah dizie. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 102:11, Isa. 40:7-8.</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Mdakkepie liakelube samlam pungtu. Kedanemene pa cikenzwa kedei kecu kah gwang lucai, pa Tinggwang pecu ku kelame dage sampet kai kebeu kering peurwa de ngau luzie. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Peu migede de mdakkepie pe da kegwang dau, “Acu Tinggwang ne kedakpie zeu,” de eh rang so, kedanemene Tinggwang de makesiabe ne kedakpie gailak, nah pa migede de kedak lama lu. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Dede mige ge kecu pekatei pe pumteih lungning ne pecu teuswa mdei nah keulu eh mdakkepie gage kai dila. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Pecai pumteih lungning tetlak luge, kemau mna beula, nah kemau, lung cuh luge, ketsai mna beula. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Kehung a sinamedung, nnuide cwa diso. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Mapeu keyi leune nah mtamapeu yicangsiak kecu leune nreule de gwang, cide kebaabe Peibe, lidai dila kemakpe mede mimie nzwa nreu dila kemakbe dade gwangla. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Pe lungning gade pa anuide kesang sam gade tei mlung gaibeu, iciu eh pa damkegai ma pelane kakde anuide peu raitume ge teilu kerane.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kekingnei nah bata ketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Kehung a sinamedung, aide cilu: Peu mileune de kingnei mzetlu, marang zette so, nah rata zette so. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Kedanemene mina rata au Tinggwang masangbe pwa peula melu. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Ciziemne, kemau kehera nah hezai kesia pelane keugi dilu, delwe lingkegai samde hena eh luulu, cidene nnui rabe de kelilu bui. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Dede nnuikatei nnuide cwa teu eh kekingneime rünne teidi mene sambe tei kemzaime tei lulo. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Kedanemene keheibe de sam kekingneibe dede teikemzaibe ge mecai, pa au mige miakpiebung gade pekatei pe zu pie kegai nzwa da. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Kedanemene pa pekatei pemie piegai eh tetti la nah zette perehi dainzwa bi kecu nsungta dila. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Dede mide lung mpetlu kela hezai yicangsiak kecude pie sünne gai eh cide tei jüja bam kelabe, kingnei gai eh nsungta dila kemakpe, dede cide tei mzai kelabe, aipaude de pe bata peureu gage samlam beuzie. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Mige pe mleu ketip mene, dede pe lung cwateu eh pekatei pecule pwa renet lam mcok lie cetla cai, pe renet au kemta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:13">Lei. 34:13</ref>;<ref loc="PSA 141:3">141:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Tinggwang nah Peibe dwa de renet mci nah herakemakbe au aide: nggianadung nah hemipuidung keherei kebam ga ngha kera, nah mikatei mide kideube dade tei heradi mene kaipwa bamlu kera deda.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Heneu herüt teiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />A sinamedung, anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista kendu de nlum kelame heneuherüt tei kerabe ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Job 34:19, Lei. 24:7-10.</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Kedanemene mige kecak bakap nah pai keyi teulwe nnui ngqwa ga lütcai, nah kegahme gede pai kesia teulwe lütcai, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />nah nnui pai keyi teu kelabe de piegai delwe, “Nang bam keyi aika bamlu,” de rangcai, nah makegahbe dage nnui, “Nang cika saplu” mede “A pi bam ga bamlu,” de rangcai, <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />iciu cai nnuikatei nnui kakde teuntsam kecu tei nah lungning kesia teu eh tutiakme teidi de meni? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Kiengnei lu, kehung sinamedung, Tinggwang kideu ga kegahme de peu kenlum ga heilu kerane nah pecu hung kelame de pa sampet kebeu hegwangram de gumlu kerane kedetlu meni? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Dede nnui kegahme de teu hengam tei dida! Keheime ne nnuide teikeherei nah penui ne nnuide tutiakbam ga teugwang meni? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Penui nnuide qukelu hezi keyi de rangmsia ladi de meni? <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ciciu liede, kesanglaisiu ga raupwa kela nzwa nnui hezai kedi de, “Nang nkatei ncu keku nzwa n kidabe de kuzie,” de kecu de teicang lucai, nnui teihemi da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Dede nnui heneu herüt teicai, nnui kemau tei dida, nah hezaibe ne hezaigikah kecume lie mmaula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev. 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Kedanemene keheibe de hezai pelane mzailu dede ket gade kaudi liecai, hezai pelane gade mau dida. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Kedanemene, “Mmha so,” de rangkelabe, “Mide daptset so,” de eh de rang delu. Cine, nnui mmha meliede, nnui mide daptset cai, nnui hezaigikah kecume ge dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 20:13-14, Hez. 5:17-18.</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Cine teumpet kebeu zaide ne tiak lai eh kebammedung nzwa eh rang nah tei lulo. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Kedanemene mide ngaungia la kemakpe de ngaugia si mene pe tutiak zie. Ngaugia au tutiak reu ngkieng lula.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenlum nah bata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />A sinamedung, mi kangge pe kenlum bamlie rangla liede pe bata gah cai cide pe kemmi daipai no? Kenlum cide pecu kelilu buini? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Magade mi sinapei ge mede mi tipui ge paiheni kesia teu nah tingnai ramsang ne taktyei bam ma, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />nah nnui mige penai dage, “Nnai lung nciep eh gwanglu, lumlu nah tyei nggeilu,” de eh rang de penai pumteihbe ziemne teu mai kesiadung peu mecai, cide pekeyi daipai no? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Cine kenlum rünne au, cide bata si mecai, ketsai lie. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Dede mikangge, “Nang n kenlum bam, nah Ih a bata bam,” de eh rang zie. Bata si mene n kenlum pwa acu lia lo, iciude Ih a bata gade a kenlum pwa ncu liazie. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Nang Tinggwang au ket rünne lie kecu nlumla. Nang tei dau da. Herakesiabedung de nlumla, nah penui mbeu bamla. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Dede, nang kemiebo, kenlum au bata simai kemta lie kecu nang cilu neu lani?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiudung kesa peila</char><char style="fqa">kenlum bata si kemak au ketsai.</char> </note> <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Anui pei Abraham pe bata le pecu tei masanglu meni, pe napei Isaac de recabam reu gage reca kegai dau?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:9">Ken. 22:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Nang kenlum pe bata sila kecu, nah bata gade kenlum teicang beu kela ci lulo. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Kesanglaisiu rang kelade teicanglu, “Nah Abraham Tinggwang de nlumlu, nah cide ne pecu masang lie luulu,” nah pecu Tinggwang zangnabe lie qulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Ken. 15:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Cine nnui kenlum rünne gade mene bata le mide tei masanglu kela ci lulo. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Nah cinzwa eh helipui Rahab de pe bata le pecu tei masanglu meni, pa samgwamedung de hegialwe penuide lampui kedale de langgi kedidau?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Heb. 11:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Kedanemene mi pumbe au rabe simai ketsai kecu nzwa, cinzwa eh kenlum de bata simai ketsai lie.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Mimleu kezeu kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Sinamedung, nnui mina kekiee de peu keledeume teiso, kedanemene anui mide ledeu kelame de au mtingki eh hetutiak zielie kecu nnui cibam lu. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Kedanemene anui pelane de ma kekiee ge tei maula. Mige pe samrang gade ma tei maula mecai, pa au mina yicangsiak dida, pe pum pelane kecangde kezeu lubui. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Cu anui hekwendung mui gage peu penuide anui samzai teilu kerane kekangria kaicai, anui penui pum pelane teu anui suibe tei lubui. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Liemdung zaide cetgai pielo, cidungde disüt nah tingkai ketsi ne gui teula liede, liem keteube kehereutie keceuna gele kereu lula nah mie keneule teumie lula. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Cide nzwa eh mi mleu au mipum gade keceu nage, dede cide marang hegie mdi süt lula. Ainie, mi keceu nage ne hegung kedi ge rudila. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Nah mi mleu au mi delie, kemau deu ge. Mi mleu anui pumgim kakgage kai eh mipum pelane teimsiadi nah cide anui teilung pelane gage mi teincuh beula, nah mi cide mijaai gade twagai la. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Kedanemene renaam kaune ketsamtsam pelane, nruine, bwakelakaune, nah duikaunedung de mina ne kezeu gwang nah kezeu lula. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Dede migede mi mleu de kezeu luma. Cide au mtakla kemak kesia, ketsai heiring le pui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 140:3">Lei. 140:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Cide le anui Rampaube nah Peibe de twala, nah cide le anui mina, Tinggwang rehi gade tei kelume de resetla. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Muige gade samlam nah reset petla. A sinamedung, ma aidungde teidi maisia ma. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Duirwak mui ge gade kekum nah kekaa dui lwapet lubui ni? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />A sinamedung, tangzüttsi bang gade Olive tsi bui lubui ni? Mede kubetsi bang gade tangzüttsidung bui lubui ni? Mede Teijai dui gade dui kemci pet gailak.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maci ketsam kena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Nnui kakgade caube maci nah kecikecet bamno? Peu pecu hena nah maci teu eh ba ta keyi tei kegai gade teilung keyi lungh eh mide lia lulo. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Dede nnui lung gade mide ngau nnui riaksiasüt nah heziu keci bamcai, ngang eh kesangbe de kenretbe tei diso. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Aipaude au nreu lede kegwang maci ma, dede cide au kideube gade, rabe lamde ma, nah herakesiabe lam delie. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Kedanemene riaksiet nah heziu keci kela ga, kehebwak nah kesia ketei leune lala. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Dede nreulede kegwang maci au keraibe mci, pecai nciep, mnwa, kesamtei, ngaugia nah petsi keyidung le pui, heneu herüt tei lama nah hezai tei lama. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Nah kesamsang tsi de au kezuyi teibeu kelame ne kezuyi gade linggai beula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:17">Isa. 32:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Ncu pwa Tinggwang de peulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Daigade hereu ketei nah keregi kecu nnui kakga gwang lano? Cidungde nnui hengindung, nnui pumteih ga renia kela gade gwang la meni? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Nnui mahengin, dede nnui ngaulu lama. Nnui mide teitset nah migu luuneu la, dede nnui ngaulu lama. Nnui regi nah hereu teila. Nnui luu keneube ngaulu lama kedanemene nnui kiela kemakne. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Nnui kiela nah ngau lu lama, kedanemene nnui petau kemak gade kiela, iciu eh nnui cide nnui hengindung ga teulu kerane. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Nnui helipuidung!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Helipuidung! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang nah pe minadung kakga kelak ge teuncüt kelu rehi de nzwa kebam ga, Israelme helipui ge nzwa samsanglu tadi nah mamie kereca lam nreudi eh caihakecimedung ne penuide kesiugai kecu sam (Hos. 1-3;9.1; Jer. 3:6-10,20). </char></note> Kideube de ngngwa zangna ketei au Tinggwang ngauraume lie kecu nnui ci meni? Cine keheibe de kideube de ngngwa zangna tei keneume au pekatei pecu Tinggwang ngauraume ge tei dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:15">1 Jhn. 2:15</ref>,<ref loc="1JN 2:16">16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Mede nnui kesanglaisiu au pekie gah eh, “Pa anui lung gage tei mlung kegai Kemci Rabe de mide ngau periak lani”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Tet. 20:5</ref>;<ref loc="EXO 34:14">34:14</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 8:2">Zec. 8:2</ref></char></note> de rangla lie cet zeu no? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Dede Tinggwang ngaugia peu kieeki la. Cine kesanglaisiu rangla, “Tinggwang ngang kelame de mlaila, dede henah kelame de ngaugia peula.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Mac. 3:34</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Cine Tinggwang dage henah gailu. Dede herakesiabe de renia lu, iciude pa nnui dade pak dizie. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Tinggwang da nna gwanglu, iciude pa nnui da nna gwang luzie. Nnui kemaumedung, nnui badung ntiakmci di, nah nnui lungna pung kelamedung,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lungna pung kelamedung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hezaiteikelame de rangbam. </char></note> nnui mlung teimci lu. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Nnui lung sialu nah heei eh haplu! Nnui nuikelade peu kehap ge dilu, nah nnui suiyi kelade peu suisiet ge dilu. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Rampaube dwade nnuide tei henah lu, iciude pa nnuide teucuh beuzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:6">Lei. 147:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />A sinamedung, hangge ge de rang msia so. Mige pe sinabe de rang msia mede pe sinabe de tiak kelabe hezaibe de rang msia nah hezaibe de tiakla. Dede nang hezaibe de tiak lacai, nang au hezai tei kemzaibe meda, dede tiak kelabe da. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Hezai kaikebeube nah hetuketiak au ket rünne. Kelilu kebuibe nah ngkapdi lu kebuibe au Tinggwang. Cine nang n kidabe tutiak kelabe cauno?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ncünne ziemne hegie kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Cu ainie, nnui ainzwa rang kelame, “Anui henai mede ncünne namdi aide ga mie zie, delwe cika mmi ge bam eh heli tei gie luzie,” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />dede nnui ncünne ha cima. Nnui teilung dai no? Kedanemene nnui au mikaa kak nage ngau gai eh gah di kela nzwa delie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 27:1">Mac. 27:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Meliene, nnui ainzwa rang kerabe, “Rampaube lungning liecai, anui lungh bam eh aide mede lude tei zie.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Dede cu au nnui mariemdung ziemne nnui ngangla dida. Ngang kecu cinkenzwa leune au kemau lie. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Cine mige makeyibe teikera cibam eh cide tei mecai, cide pe ziemne kemau lie.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Makeheime de mriak lulo kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Cu ainie, nnui heikelame, nnui suisia nah haplu, kedanemene keherei nnui dwaga gwang ladi delu. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Nnui maheidung rim dida, nah nnui paidung taklei ne tyei luda. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Nnui gu kecak nah rangkanggeu mtutei dida, nah cidungde mtuketei au nnuide kemmau zierang ge zie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemmau zierang ge zie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mtu ketei cide au nnui rangkang keu petau tei kemak zeirang da. </char></note> nah cide mi nzwa nnui teih tyei luzie. Nnui kamtu benai ziemne nnui mahei hekwa luda. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ainie, nnui luhdung luhlüt kela maketeime ziehi, nnui kainzeu kedi de ncam bam dida, nah luhkegetme kehap kwa reugwame reu Rampaube kwen ga gwangcang bam dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev. 19:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Nnui kideu ga lungh kehega nah nnuikatei nnui suibe tei dida. Nnui dap ketset tingba benai ziemne nnuikatei nnuide tei pwa nnui luiyi luda. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Nnui makesangbe de mmau nah teitset dida. Pa nnuide renia ma.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keherei kecu ga liakelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />A sinamedung, cine Rampaube gwang kemaktane nnui lung tei eh kwa bamlu. Pielo, hetaketabe hangdeu gade pemi kewhung luhlüt de ngaulu kera kwa bamla, pa au pelungtie eh cide ziemne tingrui keraibe nah tingrui kekambe ngaulu kemaktane kwa bamla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:14">Lev. 11:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Nnuide nnui lungtie eh kwa lulo. Nnui lung tei ngkienglu, kedanemene Rampaube cailigwang kera ting nnadi delu. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />A sinamedung, hangge ge de mmau eh ncam so, iciude nnui tutiak lak. Ainie, hetuketiakbe kimui ga sapzeu lie. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />A sinamedung, caihakecimedung Rampaube zi gade marang kegaime, keherei nah penui lung ketie de gade saukelia de peilo. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ainie, liakelumede anui samlam kepung melie qula. Nnui Job pelung ketie ha siu da, nah nnui Rampaube kekamle dainzwa teigwang bi kecu cida, Rampaube au daikenzwa gede pezaiyi nah mide ngaunggia bi kecu.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Dede bam kapde, a sinamedung, tinggim mede kideu mede makeda sampet kette teu eh reset so. Dede, “Yeo” cai “Yeo” delu nah “Ma” cai “Ma” de lulo, iciu lude nnui tutiak kangga gwang dilak.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenlumme kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Nnui kakga mige keherei bam ni? Peu pecu kekie teilu. Mige pe suiyi bam ni? Peu pecu ketwalei teilu. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Nnui kakga mige mateei bam ni? Peu pecu ngqwa ga hangkiamedung de qulu, delwe peu penuide pe reu gage kekie tei gailu, Rampaube zi gade maca le pecu keniaklu eh. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Nah kenlumme kekie gade keteeibe de teingkei luzie, nah Rampaube pecu teucuh beuzie. Nah pa kemau tei pwabam cai, Tinggwang pe mau gibeu zie. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Cine hangge ge dage nnui mau petlu, nah hangge ge ziemne kielu, iciu de nnui yi ngkei luzie. Kesamsangme kekie au pe kengkieng bamsüt. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elijah de mina anui kenzwame geda. Pa peu tingrui helo ntingsüt eh kiegai, nah mmi kecum eh keiherok ge ziemne hangdeu reu ga tingrui tadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Heg. 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Pecai pa kiegai dai, nah tinggim gade tingrui kaibeu, nah kideube petsi builu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:42-45">1 Heg. 18:42-45</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />A sinamedung, nnui kakga mige kesangbe gade ndei tetdi eh lacai, nah mige pecu ngngwa gwangdai lucai, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />peu cipaude de cilu: keheibe de kemaume gede pe lampui maukela gade teunreu gwang kelube pe rabe de ketsai gade kelilu zie, nah kemaudung kekiee ge gibeu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Mac. 10:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>